			"notes": "## Changes\n\n- More animation tweaks\n- Updated sprites for Ice (freezing) and Nature (poison) damage\n- Added a new `combatnumbers:deep` skin for deep dark-related damage (currently only the Warden's Sonic Boom uses this)\n- Added `combatnumbers:holy` and `combatnumbers:blood` skins, but they are unused at the moment. I plan to use these for future compatibility with magic mods, but you can already start using them in your own datapacks.\n- Added config option for showing damage numbers through walls\n- Skins and animations will now look for a `default.json` file as fallback if the requested file matching the identifier (i.e. `combatnumbers:some_nonexistent_skin`) is not found\n\n## Fixes\n\n- Fix icon for NeoForge builds not being embedded into the metadata properly"
		},
